        "subject": "Final Exam Day ",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>Certification Exam Invitation</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#eef0f4; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#eef0f4; padding:50px 0;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(17,17,17,0.08);\">\n\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#111827; padding:45px 30px; text-align:center;\">\n              <p style=\"color:#9CA3AF; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 12px; font-weight:600;\">\n                Certification Exam\n              </p>\n              <h1 style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:28px; margin:0; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.3px;\">\n                It's Time to Take Your Exam 🎓\n              </h1>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:40px 40px 10px;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size:16px; color:#111827; margin:0 0 20px;\">\n                Hi <strong>{{ $('On form submission').item.json.Name }}</strong>,\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 18px;\">\n                Congratulations on reaching the final milestone of the\n                <strong style=\"color:#111827;\">n8n Course of Automation</strong>! Over the past\n                30 days, you've learned to build powerful automation workflows — and now it's time\n                to put that knowledge to the test.\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 25px;\">\n                Your certification exam is now live. Click the button below whenever you're ready\n                to begin.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Exam Card -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 40px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F9FAFB; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:10px; padding:30px; text-align:center;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td>\n                    <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#111827; margin:0 0 20px; font-weight:600;\">\n                      Your Certification Exam is Ready\n                    </p>\n                    <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSceq5cfbxEAZjMLBd3yYBCRuYtvijZpjnAYUkW7KsMo0U5F-g/viewform?usp=publish-editor\" target=\"_blank\"\n                       style=\"background-color:#111827; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; padding:16px 44px; border-radius:8px; display:inline-block;\">\n                      Start Your Exam\n                    </a>\n                    <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6B7280; margin:18px 0 0; line-height:1.6;\">\n                      Please complete the exam in one sitting for the best experience.\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Guidelines -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px 40px 5px;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#111827; margin:0 0 15px; font-weight:600;\">\n                Before you begin, please note:\n              </p>\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.7;\">\n                    📌 Ensure a stable internet connection before starting\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.7;\">\n                    📌 Set aside uninterrupted time to complete the exam\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.7;\">\n                    📌 Answer to the best of your understanding of course concepts\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.7;\">\n                    📌 Reach out in the WhatsApp group if you face any issues\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Closing -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px 40px 10px;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 18px;\">\n                You've worked hard to get here, and we're confident you're ready for this. Take a\n                deep breath, trust your preparation, and give it your best shot.\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 18px;\">\n                Once you submit your exam, your <strong style=\"color:#111827;\">result and\n                certificate will be delivered within 3 hours</strong> — so keep an eye on your inbox!\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#111827; margin:20px 0 0; font-weight:600;\">\n                Best of luck on your certification exam! 🚀\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:35px 40px; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB; text-align:center;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#111827; margin:0; font-weight:600;\">\n                Warm regards\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n\n        <p style=\"font-size:12px; color:#9CA3AF; margin-top:22px;\">\n          This email was sent because you enrolled in the n8n Course of Automation.\n        </p>\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
